    "Content": "<div><div><p><span><span>Azure Database for PostgreSQL </span><span>- </span><span>Flexible Server now supports the </span></span><a href=\"https://github.com/laurenz/oracle_fdw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span><span>oracle_fdw extension</span></span></a><span><span>.</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>This </span><span>f</span><span>oreign </span><span>d</span><span>ata </span><span>w</span><span>rapper </span><span>gives you easy </span><span>access to your Oracle databases</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>via foreign tables.</span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span><span>&nbsp;</span><br></span><span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p></div><div><p><span></span><a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/postgresql/flexible-server/concepts-extensions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span><span>Learn more</span></span></a><span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p></div><br></div>",
